     *       entity expansion, external resource access, and other
     *       potentially dangerous features.</li>
     *   <li>Explicitly disables external DTD and stylesheet access by
     *       setting the corresponding attributes to an empty string.</li>
     *   <li>Validates that the input stream is non‑null before proceeding.</li>
     * </ul>
